    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ic wille þæt tunesmen ⁊ heora hyrdas habban þas ylcan smeagunge on minum cucum orfe ⁊ on minra þegena, ealswa hy habbað on heora agenum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it is my will that villagers and their herdsmen shall have the same right of investigation with regard to my livestock and that of my thegn as they have with regard to their own.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ic wille, þæt tunesmen ⁊ heora hyrdas habban þás ylcan smeagunge on minum cucum orfe ⁊ on minra þegena, ealswa hy habbað on heora ágenum.</ab>
      </div>
